3. How do you handle failure in deployment?
Answer:
 "First, I check the pipeline logs and deployment status to identify the root cause. Then I check the application logs, configuration, Docker image, and Kubernetes resources. After fixing the issue, I redeploy and verify the application. If the new version is causing the problem, I rollback to the previous stable version."

> Hindi me Question ka matlab:
"Agar deployment fail ho jaye to tum kya karoge?"
Interviewer tumhara troubleshooting approach check kar raha hai.
> Formula:
Check Logs
   ↓
Find Root Cause
   ↓
Fix
   ↓
Redeploy
   ↓
Verify
   ↓
Rollback if required

