6. Name three important DevOps KPIs.
Answer:
"Three important DevOps KPIs are Deployment Frequency, Lead Time for Changes, and Mean Time to Recovery, or MTTR."

> Hindi me Question ka matlab:
"DevOps team ki performance ko measure karne ke liye 3 important metrics batao."

> Simple meaning:
Deployment Frequency
→ Kitni frequently deployment hoti hai.
Lead Time for Changes
→ Code change se deployment tak kitna time lagta hai.
MTTR
→ Failure ke baad system recover karne me kitna time lagta hai.

> Interview Tip:
Agar interviewer 4th pooche:
Change Failure Rate → Kitni deployments failure cause karti hain.

7. What duties are you performing with Git, Docker, Kubernetes, Ansible, Jenkins, GitLab, and Terraform?
Answer:
 "I use Git and GitLab for source code management and collaboration. Jenkins is used to automate the CI/CD pipeline. Docker is used to build and run application containers. Kubernetes is used to deploy, scale, and manage containers. Terraform is used for infrastructure provisioning. Ansible is used for configuration management and automation."

