9. Explain the pipeline of your project and its purpose.
Answer:

"In my project, the developer pushes code to Git. Jenkins triggers the pipeline and checks out the code. The application is built and tested, followed by code quality and security checks. Then a Docker image is created and pushed to the container registry. The updated deployment configuration is applied to Kubernetes, and finally we perform post-deployment validation and monitoring."

Hindi me Question ka matlab:

"Tumhare project me code developer ke laptop se production tak kaise jata hai?"

Interviewer end-to-end CI/CD flow check kar raha hai.

Simple Flow:
Developer
 ↓
Git
 ↓
Jenkins
 ↓
Build
 ↓
Test
 ↓
Security/Quality Scan
 ↓
Docker Image
 ↓
Registry
 ↓
Kubernetes
 ↓
Monitoring
Purpose:

Manual work kam karna aur reliable, repeatable deployment karna.

