14. What types of deployments do you follow in your project?
Answer:

"We mainly use Rolling Deployment because it allows us to update the application gradually without significant downtime. Depending on the requirement, Blue-Green or Canary deployment can also be used for safer releases."

Hindi me Question ka matlab:

"New version ko production me release karne ka method kya use karte ho?"

Important strategies:

Rolling Update

Old Pod → New Pod
Old Pod → New Pod

Blue-Green

Blue = Old
Green = New

Canary

10% Users → New
90% Users → Old


