# DevOps Project ka complete answer
> Agar interviewer bole "Tell me about your DevOps project", to short me:
"In my project, developers push code to Git. Jenkins automatically triggers the CI/CD pipeline, builds and tests the application, and performs quality and security checks. Docker is used to containerize the application, and the image is pushed to a registry. Kubernetes is used for deployment and scaling. Terraform is used to provision infrastructure, while monitoring tools are used to track application health and performance."

> Sabse important rule
Interview me tool ka naam → uska kaam → tumne kahan use kiya.
> Example:
"I used Docker to containerize the application so that the application and its dependencies could run consistently across environments."


